OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water is to expand water use
OL,7,Frestrictions for its customers across
OL,8,FSussex.
OL,10,FThe firm is removing an exemption for
OL,11,Fvulnerable people on the company's
OL,12,Fregister to its hosepipe ban from 9
OL,13,FOctober to "protect water supplies and
OL,14,Fthe environment". An exemption remains
OL,15,Ffor health and safety reasons and
OL,16,Fanimal welfare.
OL,18,FHead of water resources Nick Price told
OL,19,FBBC Radio Sussex the "fairly unusual"
OL,20,Fexpansion of the ban that came into
OL,21,Fplace in July was due to lower rainfall
OL,22,Fthan expected.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
