OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban extended to
OL,4,Avulnerable across Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has separately applied to
OL,7,Fthe Department for Environment, Food
OL,8,Fand Rural Affairs for a ban on all
OL,9,Fnon-essential commercial water usage.
